# My Personal Portfolio

Welcome to my personal portfolio website! This project showcases my background, technical skills, and projects as a Computer Science graduate.

## About the Project

This portfolio features a modern galaxy-inspired design with animations and interactive elements to provide an engaging browsing experience.

## Features

- Modern and responsive user interface
- Animated galaxy-inspired background
- Interactive 3D project cards
- Scroll reveal animations
- Personal introduction and skills section
- Projects showcase
- Contact information

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## How to Run Locally

1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open `index.html` in your web browser.

No additional setup is required if the project uses only HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

